validation+='\n## Model findings and limitations\n\n- 87 retained source objects include partial external dependency interfaces; this does not make the full external applications part of the implementation scope.\n- Read-only legacy fields with no proven source mechanism and null length/precision/timezone metadata remain unresolved rather than receiving fabricated values.\n- The baseline same-name Id declaration on Inspection is retained with its distinct stable identifier; do not delete or shadow it during build without platform analysis.\n- Formal Finding storage/history and other framework consumers remain installed. Target Inspections entry, reporting and submission use responses/direct actions.\n- External resource authority, role resolution, native attachment identification, compiled publication and immediate completion must be verified before corresponding features are activated.\n- The 16 ADRs retain their original accepted/proposed status. The three-program setup values, reminder interval and categorical labels are proposed implementation choices, not rewritten ADR approvals.\n\n## Required validation checklist disposition\n';
validation+=table(['Skill rule','Disposition'],[['VAL-01/02 Formula vocabulary/dependencies','No new executable expressions asserted; new dependencies modelled; tenant syntax/context/type checks P-04.'],['VAL-03 Inverse grids','Existing declaration ownership preserved; inverse-only partial export recorded; new catalogue inverse disabled; native attachments not duplicate stored relationships.'],['VAL-04/05 Version atomicity/uniqueness','Explicit publication and generation acceptance cases; runtime proof P-03.'],['VAL-06 Handler recursion','Watched fields/allowlists documented; metadata-only writes excluded; runtime proof P-04/P-09.'],['VAL-07 Native evidence','No custom evidence object removed; native audit/history required.'],['VAL-08 Direct access','Role matrix and direct URL/export/attachment/mobile tests AC-13; tenant test pending.'],['VAL-09 Date/time','New timestamps timezone enabled; existing review timestamp normalization requires original timezone mapping.'],['VAL-10 Removal','No physical removal/reparenting; deprecation is scoped UI/behavior only.'],['VAL-11/12 Catalogues','New independent governed catalogues have Code/Name/Active/Sort, individual seeds and disabled selector inverses; no new abstract catalogue family or reparenting.'],['VAL-13 Field contract','One exact row per field/navigation and subsection per object; explicit unresolved details prevent claiming a fully validated implementation contract.'],['VAL-14 Terminology','Inheritance parent contains only direct base/None/Unresolved; record associations remain separate.']]);
